E AX3069 cast-surplus-measure.ax:1:52-59 sizeof-arity "`sizeof` takes one type and answers a constant, so this argument has nowhere to go" #"extra argument" !"it used to be discarded in silence" ?"remove the extra argument"
E AX3139 cast-unit-source.ax:1:44-45 unit-cast "`as` cannot convert from `()`: it has one value and carries no information" #"a cast through `()`" !"a cast through `()` answers the unit word 0 whatever the value was, so the conversion could only lose what it was given" ?"convert a value that carries information, or drop the cast"
